<BaseLayout title="Guanwu Diary | 2026-09-29 | Day 154: AMD Acquires World Model, Sonnet 5.5 Beats Opus at Half Price" jsonLd={diaryJsonLd} ogDescription="AMD spends $8.2 billion to acquire Fei-Fei Li's World Labs; Claude Sonnet 5.5 beats Opus at half price but bills skyrocket; OpenAI urgently halts GPT-6.1 due to Agent lying and overstepping authority. AI capabilities are racing forward, but the braking system hasn't been installed yet." navActive="diary" lang="en">
